Now patch build-and-upload.ps1 to auto-load smtp.env when SmtpHost not passed. Insert after `$env:JAVA_HOME = $JdkHome` (line 53) or before. Need `$repoRoot` defined at line 51. Insert after line 53.

Code:

```powershell
# SMTP можно не передавать параметрами: если рядом лежит scripts/smtp.env
# (он в .gitignore), креды подхватятся автоматически.
$smtpEnvFile = Join-Path $repoRoot "scripts\smtp.env"
if (-not $SmtpHost -and (Test-Path $smtpEnvFile)) {
    foreach ($line in Get-Content $smtpEnvFile) {
        $line = $line.Trim()
        if (-not $line -or $line.StartsWith('#')) { continue }
        $pair = $line -split '=', 2
        if ($pair.Count -ne 2) { continue }
        $key = $pair[0].Trim()
        $value = $pair[1].Trim()
        switch ($key) {
            'SMTP_HOST' { $SmtpHost = $value }
            'SMTP_PORT' { $SmtpPort = $value }
            'SMTP_USER' { $SmtpUser = $value }
            'SMTP_PASSWORD' { $SmtpPassword = $value }
            'SMTP_FROM' { $SmtpFrom = $value }
            'VERIFICATION_DEV_CODE' { if (-not $VerificationDevCode) { $VerificationDevCode = $value } }
        }
    }
    if ($SmtpHost) { Write-Host "==> SMTP взят из scripts/smtp.env ($SmtpUser)" -ForegroundColor DarkGray }
}
```

Careful: `$line.StartsWith('#')` works on string. Fine.

Also if VERIFICATION_DEV_CODE in smtp.env commented, no effect.

